{"id":"n15536-7-5","stage":3,"title":"묶이다 · 被汇总","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15536-7-5-1","ko":"이게 신제품인가 보죠?","zh":"这是新款产品吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"2","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신제품인가","meaning":"新产品","explanation":"신제품：新产品；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"신제품","audio":"/audio/88654a37295045f57a46.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14072","senseId":"1","lemma":"신제품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보죠?","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代前面刚刚提到的对象。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"88654a37295045f5","term":"신제품","zh":"新产品","audio":"/audio/88654a37295045f57a46.mp3","entryId":"14072","definition":"新制造的产品。","pronunciation":["신제품"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a9877f0954e4ff2479a7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15536-7-5-2","ko":"네, 기존 인기 제품들의 장점들이 다 묶인 제품이에요.","zh":"是的，它汇集了现有热门产品的所有优点。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기존","meaning":"现有，现存","explanation":"기존：现有，现存","readings":[{"term":"기존","audio":"/audio/34986eb88c500691d659.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38049","senseId":"1","lemma":"기존","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인기","meaning":"人气","explanation":"인기：人气","readings":[{"term":"인기","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70758","senseId":"1","lemma":"인기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제품들의","meaning":"产品，制品","explanation":"제품：产品，制品；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"제품","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70898","senseId":"1","lemma":"제품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장점들이","meaning":"优点，长处","explanation":"장점：优点，长处；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장점","audio":"/audio/359027c169a8afa3896f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71209","senseId":"1","lemma":"장점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"묶인","meaning":"被汇总，被汇编，被汇集","explanation":"묶이다：被汇总，被汇编，被汇集；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"묶이다","audio":"/audio/9e9e08c101bb83e19569.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15536","senseId":"7","lemma":"묶이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제품이에요.","meaning":"产品，制品","explanation":"제품：产品，制品；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"제품","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70898","senseId":"1","lemma":"제품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"34986eb88c500691","term":"기존","zh":"现有，现存","audio":"/audio/34986eb88c500691d659.mp3","entryId":"38049","definition":"已经存在。","pronunciation":["기존"]},{"id":"97bd6aed2c720b21","term":"인기","zh":"人气","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3","entryId":"70758","definition":"许多人对某个对象的浓厚兴趣或喜爱之心。","pronunciation":["인끼"]},{"id":"60be380dfd52bdfe","term":"제품","zh":"产品，制品","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3","entryId":"70898","definition":"使用材料制作物品；或指经此做出来的物品。","pronunciation":["제ː품"]},{"id":"359027c169a8afa3","term":"장점","zh":"优点，长处","audio":"/audio/359027c169a8afa3896f.mp3","entryId":"71209","definition":"好的或擅长的或有意义的地方。","pronunciation":["장쩜"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"9e9e08c101bb83e1","term":"묶이다","zh":"被汇总，被汇编，被汇集","audio":"/audio/9e9e08c101bb83e19569.mp3","entryId":"15536","definition":"多个被合成为一个体系。","pronunciation":["무끼다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5ea13a4dc483b6effa1e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.011,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15536","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"7","sourceLevel":"중급","day":109,"sequenceScore":2.8377,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，它汇集了现有热门产品的所有优点。","从这里去医院要怎么走？","这是新款产品吧？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是的，它汇集了现有热门产品的所有优点。","这是新款产品吧？","从这里去医院要怎么走？"],"answer":0}]}
